 <body bgcolor="#000000">
  <page>
   <image href="01.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="84,68 418,68 418,139 84,139" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>ANDA DIDN'T REALLY START TO PLAY THE GAME UNTIL SHE GOT HERESELF A GIRL-SHAPED <emphasis>AVATAR.</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="470,64 685,64 685,285 470,285" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE WAS 12, AND THE ONLY GIRLS SHE'D EVER SEEN IN-GAME WERE SHAPED LIKE A BOY'S IDEA OF WHAT A GIRL LOOKED LIKE: HUGE BUZZWABS AND LONG LEGS ALL BARELY CONTAINED IN TINY, POINTLESS LEATHER BIKINI-ARMOUR.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="662,325 816,325 816,377 662,377" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p><emphasis>BINTWARE,</emphasis> SHE CALLED IT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1136,216 1138,211 1141,207 1144,203 1150,199 1155,197 1164,194 1175,193 1212,193 1223,195 1228,197 1238,203 1244,211 1246,220 1244,231 1240,237 1230,243 1215,247 1206,249 1174,249 1163,247 1151,243 1142,237 1137,227 1136,216">
       <p>HULLO, CHICKENS.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="872,459 1104,459 1104,531 872,531" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>THAT ALL CHANGED THE DAY HER SCHOOL WAS CALLED TO ASSEMBLY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="256,725 258,711 268,697 284,687 304,681 340,679 384,681 412,691 426,705 432,721 430,739 422,751 408,761 386,769 362,773 314,771 294,767 276,759 264,749 258,739">
       <p>I AM LIZA THE ORGANIZA, AND I KICK ARSE. SERIOUSLY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="732,887 744,859 772,831 816,815 860,811 920,819 960,843 984,879 992,915 988,959 968,999 932,1027 884,1039 832,1039 796,1031 760,1011 736,979 728,951 728,907">
       <p>I AM THE BEST GAMER IN THE WORLD, AND I'M EL PRESIDENTE OF THE ENTIRE <emphasis>CLAN FAHRENHEIT.</emphasis> MY BATTLE RECORD IS 3,522 KILLS IN A <emphasis>SINGLE</emphasis> BATTLE. I HAVE TAKEN HOME CASH PRIZES FROM COMPETITIONS TOTALLING MORE THAN 400,000 POUNDS.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="738,1181 742,1151 764,1121 790,1107 818,1103 848,1103 880,1109 904,1121 916,1135 924,1155 928,1171 928,1199 922,1221 912,1237 894,1251 870,1261 846,1265 820,1265 788,1259 766,1249 750,1231 738,1205">
       <p>AND I'M HERE TO LET YOU IN ON A SECRET: GIRLS KICK ARSE. WE'RE FASTER, SMARTER AND BETTER THAN BOYS. WE PLAY HARDER.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="84,1365 86,1349 94,1335 110,1323 130,1317 168,1317 188,1321 206,1333 216,1351 216,1377 206,1395 192,1405 170,1411 130,1411 114,1407 100,1399 90,1387 86,1377">
       <p>GAMESPACE SMELLS LIKE A BOY'S <emphasis>ARMPIT.</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="218,1811 222,1789 242,1767 270,1757 310,1751 352,1755 384,1765 404,1781 412,1805 412,1825 396,1849 368,1863 344,1869 284,1869 246,1857 226,1841 220,1827">
       <p>WE'RE GOING TO CHANGE THAT, CHICKENS, YOU LOT AND ME. SO HERE'S MY OFFER TO YOU ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="396,1363 404,1339 424,1319 456,1307 492,1303 544,1303 572,1307 596,1315 612,1323 628,1339 632,1359 628,1387 608,1407 584,1415 552,1423 476,1423 444,1415 424,1407 404,1391">
       <p>... IF YOU WILL PLAY AS A GIRL, YOU WILL BE GIVEN <emphasis>PROBATIONARY MEMBERSHIPS</emphasis> IN THE CLAN FAHRENHEIT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="456,1699 460,1675 472,1651 488,1639 512,1631 556,1631 580,1639 600,1655 612,1679 612,1711 604,1743 576,1767 536,1775 504,1771 480,1759 464,1739 456,1719">
       <p>AND IF YOU MEASURE UP, YOU'LL BECOME FULL-FLEDGED MEMBERS. SO WHO'S IN, CHICKENS?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1024,1727 1240,1727 1240,1863 1024,1863" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>THE FAHRENHEITS HAD CHAPTERS IN <emphasis>EVERY</emphasis> GAME. THEY WERE AMAZING AND DEADLY AND COOL. AND ANDA WAS GOING TO BE ONE OF THEM.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="84,68 418,68 418,139 84,139" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>ANDA NEZAČALA HRAŤ HRU SKÔR NEŽ DOSTALA <emphasis>AVATARA</emphasis> V TVARE DIEVČAŤA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="470,64 685,64 685,285 470,285" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>MALA 12, A JEDINÉ DIEVČATÁ, KTORÉ KEDY V HRE VIDELA, BOLI TVAROVANÉ AKO CHLAPČENSKÁ PREDSTAVA DIEVČAT: VEĽKÉ PRSIA A DLHÉ NOHY A TO VŠETKO NAPRATANÉ DO MALÉHO, NEZMYSELNÉHO KOŽENÉHO BIKINI-BRNENIA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="662,325 816,325 816,377 662,377" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p><emphasis>BINTWARE,</emphasis> TO VOLALA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1136,216 1138,211 1141,207 1144,203 1150,199 1155,197 1164,194 1175,193 1212,193 1223,195 1228,197 1238,203 1244,211 1246,220 1244,231 1240,237 1230,243 1215,247 1206,249 1174,249 1163,247 1151,243 1142,237 1137,227 1136,216">
       <p>HALÓ, MAČIATKA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="872,459 1104,459 1104,531 872,531" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>TO VŠETKO SA ZMENILO V DEŇ, KEĎ ICH ŠKOLA BOLA ZVOLANÁ NA ZHROMAŽDENIE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="256,725 258,711 268,697 284,687 304,681 340,679 384,681 412,691 426,705 432,721 430,739 422,751 408,761 386,769 362,773 314,771 294,767 276,759 264,749 258,739">
       <p>JA SOM LÍZA ORGANÍZA, A SOM STRAŠNE COOL. VÁŽNE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="732,887 744,859 772,831 816,815 860,811 920,819 960,843 984,879 992,915 988,959 968,999 932,1027 884,1039 832,1039 796,1031 760,1011 736,979 728,951 728,907">
       <p>SOM NAJLEPŠÍ HRÁČ NA SVETE, A SOM "EL PRESIDENTE" CELÉHO <emphasis>KLANU FAHRENHEIT.</emphasis> MÔJ REKORD NA BOJISKU JE 3522 ZABITÍ V <emphasis>JEDINEJ</emphasis> BITKE. PRINIESLA SOM SI DOMOV CENY Z RÔZNYCH SÚŤAŽÍ V CELKOVEJ VÝŠKE VYŠE 400 TISÍC EUR.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="738,1181 742,1151 764,1121 790,1107 818,1103 848,1103 880,1109 904,1121 916,1135 924,1155 928,1171 928,1199 922,1221 912,1237 894,1251 870,1261 846,1265 820,1265 788,1259 766,1249 750,1231 738,1205">
       <p>A PRIŠLA SOM SEM, ABY SOM VÁM PREZRADILA JEDNO TAJOMSTVO: DIEVČATÁ SÚ COOL. SME RÝCHLEJŠIE, BYSTREJŠIE A LEPŠIE AKO CHLAPCI. HRÁME USILOVNEJŠIE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="84,1365 86,1349 94,1335 110,1323 130,1317 168,1317 188,1321 206,1333 216,1351 216,1377 206,1395 192,1405 170,1411 130,1411 114,1407 100,1399 90,1387 86,1377">
       <p>HRÁČSKY PRIESTOR SMRDÍ AKO CHLAPČENSKÝ <emphasis>RITNÝ OTVOR.</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="218,1811 222,1789 242,1767 270,1757 310,1751 352,1755 384,1765 404,1781 412,1805 412,1825 396,1849 368,1863 344,1869 284,1869 246,1857 226,1841 220,1827">
       <p>MY SA TO CHYSTÁME ZMENIŤ, MAČIATKA, VY VŠETKY A JA. TU JE MOJA PONUKA ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="396,1363 404,1339 424,1319 456,1307 492,1303 544,1303 572,1307 596,1315 612,1323 628,1339 632,1359 628,1387 608,1407 584,1415 552,1423 476,1423 444,1415 424,1407 404,1391">
       <p>... AK BUDETE HRAŤ AKO HRAJÚ DIEVČATÁ, DOSTANETE <emphasis>SKÚŠOBNÉ ČLENSTVO</emphasis> V KLANE FAHRENHEIT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="456,1699 460,1675 472,1651 488,1639 512,1631 556,1631 580,1639 600,1655 612,1679 612,1711 604,1743 576,1767 536,1775 504,1771 480,1759 464,1739 456,1719">
       <p>A AK SA OSVEDČÍTE, STANETE SA PLNOPRÁVNYMI ČLENMI. TAK KTO IDE DO TOHO, MAČIATKA?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1024,1727 1240,1727 1240,1863 1024,1863" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>KLAN FAHRENHEIT MAL ODNOŽE V <emphasis>KAŽDEJ</emphasis> HRE. BOLI ÚŽASNÍ, SMRTIACI A STRAŠNE COOL. A ANDA SA CHYSTALA BYŤ JEDNOU Z NICH.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <frame points="65,52 441,52 442,652 57,650"/>
   <frame points="458,52 837,54 838,654 456,652"/>
   <frame points="855,277 886,252 932,220 980,190 994,188 1016,186 1037,182 1040,178 1050,177 1053,170 1065,165 1068,159 1056,160 1045,154 1044,145 1042,133 1039,128 1040,126 1040,102 1046,91 1051,71 1057,68 1082,67 1098,81 1103,95 1106,106 1110,115 1112,124 1112,134 1121,148 1128,159 1129,164 1142,165 1156,169 1214,166 1234,163 1248,160 1273,160 1272,446 1271,595 1271,656 851,654 853,503 853,425"/>
   <frame points="40,652 1326,657 1326,1296 38,1292"/>
   <frame points="55,1293 421,1294 421,1316 417,1317 409,1323 403,1329 399,1336 393,1349 393,1377 395,1384 399,1391 405,1399 411,1405 416,1409 421,1412 422,1548 422,1919 51,1919"/>
   <frame points="393,1349 397,1339 403,1329 412,1321 421,1316 424,1314 425,1294 822,1295 821,1518 829,1517 834,1521 836,1526 835,1533 827,1540 826,1546 823,1548 822,1922 435,1922 438,1859 438,1823 440,1419 429,1415 421,1412 406,1400 397,1387 393,1377"/>
   <frame points="840,1295 1265,1296 1264,1925 837,1922 839,1598 834,1597 833,1594 833,1581 837,1575 839,1573"/>
  </page>
  <page>
   <image href="02.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="168,551 380,551 380,733 168,733" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>EVERY EVENING AFTER SCHOOL, WHILE HER PARENTS WATCHED SOMETHING LOUD ON THE TELLY, ANDA WOULD GO ON MISSIONS WITH LUCY, HER BEST FRIEND IN-GAME.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="460,191 744,191 744,283 460,283" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>LUCY LIVED SOMEWHERE IN THE MIDDLE OF AMERICA, WHERE IT WAS ALL VOWELS - IOWA OR OHIO OR SOMETHING.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="770,281 774,263 784,249 806,237 834,231 870,231 896,235 918,243 932,255 940,281 936,299 930,311 916,321 902,327 886,331 854,333 824,331 796,323 776,305 770,287">
       <p>ANDA, HOW WOULD YOU LIKE TO MAKE SOME <emphasis>MONEY?</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="752,509 756,495 766,485 786,477 804,473 840,473 862,475 882,481 896,489 904,507 900,521 892,531 880,537 864,541 844,543 800,543 776,537 762,529 754,517 752,509">
       <p>YOU MEAN <emphasis>GOLD,</emphasis> LUCY?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1092,203 1096,187 1108,177 1128,171 1152,171 1172,175 1188,185 1194,203 1190,217 1180,227 1166,233 1142,235 1120,233 1104,225 1092,211">
       <p>CALL ME SARGE!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1044,635 1052,607 1068,591 1096,579 1144,579 1168,583 1192,595 1204,611 1212,635 1204,663 1188,679 1168,687 1132,695 1096,691 1064,679 1048,659">
       <p>AND NO, NOT GOLD. I HAVE A MISSION THAT PAYS <emphasis>REAL</emphasis> CASH.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="136,827 140,803 156,787 184,775 220,771 256,775 288,787 300,799 308,819 300,847 288,863 260,875 220,879 192,875 160,867 144,851 136,839">
       <p>SOUNDS A BIT WEIRD, SARGE. IS THAT AGAINST CLAN <emphasis>RULES?</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="462,1225 830,1225 830,1315 462,1315" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>CLAN LEADERSHIP ENFORCED A CODE OF CONDUCT THAT WAS MEANT TO ENSURE THAT NONE OF THE FAHRENHEIT GIRLIES ENDED UP BEING VIRTUAL <emphasis>PROZZIES.</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1046,807 1050,789 1060,775 1076,765 1094,759 1114,755 1150,753 1190,755 1220,761 1236,769 1252,783 1260,805 1258,823 1248,837 1232,849 1208,857 1182,861 1118,861 1088,855 1070,847 1054,833 1046,819 1046,807">
       <p>NO ... GEEZ. ALL THE EXECUTIVES IN THE CLAN PAY THE RENT DOING MISSIONS FOR MONEY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="964,1241 968,1223 976,1207 994,1193 1018,1185 1046,1181 1080,1185 1100,1191 1116,1201 1126,1215 1132,1233 1132,1253 1128,1265 1120,1277 1108,1287 1094,1293 1074,1299 1028,1299 1006,1295 988,1287 976,1275 968,1259">
       <p>BESIDES, MY CONTACT SAID THEY JUST WANT US TO GO <emphasis>KILL</emphasis> SOME GUYS.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="228,1415 232,1399 242,1387 256,1381 274,1377 300,1377 322,1381 334,1389 344,1401 346,1417 342,1433 328,1447 312,1453 270,1455 256,1451 242,1445 232,1433 230,1425 228,1415">
       <p>OH, WE'RE GOOD AT <emphasis>THAT!</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1020,1391 1028,1383 1220,1383 1228,1391 1228,1463 1216,1471 1028,1471 1020,1459" bgcolor="#000000" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt;please sorry u cn have my gold sorry!!!!!!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="612,1739 616,1725 624,1715 638,1709 658,1703 694,1701 726,1703 754,1709 770,1717 778,1727 780,1739 778,1751 770,1761 758,1767 736,1773 700,1777 662,1773 632,1765 618,1755 614,1747">
       <p>YOU'RE A <emphasis>NASTY</emphasis> PERSON, ANDA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="616,1843 624,1837 896,1837 904,1843 904,1899 896,1907 624,1909 616,1901" bgcolor="#000000" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt;I'm a Fahrenheit!!!!!</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="168,551 380,551 380,733 168,733" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>KAŽDÝ VEČER PO ŠKOLE, KEĎ JEJ RODIČIA POZERALI NIEČO HLASNO V TELKE, ANDA CHODILA NA MISIE S LUCY, JEJ NAJLEPŠOU KAMARÁTKOU V HRE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="460,191 744,191 744,283 460,283" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>LUCY ŽILA NIEKDE V STREDE SPOJENÝCH ŠTÁTOV, KDE TO BOLO VŠETKO IBA NA SAMOHLÁSKY - IOWA, OHIO ALEBO TAKÉ NIEČO.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="770,281 774,263 784,249 806,237 834,231 870,231 896,235 918,243 932,255 940,281 936,299 930,311 916,321 902,327 886,331 854,333 824,331 796,323 776,305 770,287">
       <p>ANDA, ČO TAKTO ZAROBIŤ NEJAKÉ <emphasis>PENIAZE?</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="752,509 756,495 766,485 786,477 804,473 840,473 862,475 882,481 896,489 904,507 900,521 892,531 880,537 864,541 844,543 800,543 776,537 762,529 754,517 752,509">
       <p>MYSLÍŠ <emphasis>ZLATO,</emphasis> LUCY?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1092,203 1096,187 1108,177 1128,171 1152,171 1172,175 1188,185 1194,203 1190,217 1180,227 1166,233 1142,235 1120,233 1104,225 1092,211">
       <p>VOLAJ MA SERŽANT!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1044,635 1052,607 1068,591 1096,579 1144,579 1168,583 1192,595 1204,611 1212,635 1204,663 1188,679 1168,687 1132,695 1096,691 1064,679 1048,659">
       <p>A NIE, NIE ZLATO. MÁM MISIU, KTORÁ PLATÍ <emphasis>SKUTOČNÉ</emphasis> PENIAZE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="136,827 140,803 156,787 184,775 220,771 256,775 288,787 300,799 308,819 300,847 288,863 260,875 220,879 192,875 160,867 144,851 136,839">
       <p>TO ZNIE DIVNE, SERŽANT. NIE JE TO PROTI <emphasis>PRAVIDLÁM KLANU?</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="462,1225 830,1225 830,1315 462,1315" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>VODCOVSTVO KLANU VYNUCOVALO DODRŽIAVANIE KÓDEXU SPRÁVANIA SA, KTORÝ ZABEZPEČOVAL, ŽE ŽIADNE DIEVČA Z KLANU NESKONČILO AKO VIRTUǍLNA <emphasis>PROSTITÚTKA.</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1046,807 1050,789 1060,775 1076,765 1094,759 1114,755 1150,753 1190,755 1220,761 1236,769 1252,783 1260,805 1258,823 1248,837 1232,849 1208,857 1182,861 1118,861 1088,855 1070,847 1054,833 1046,819 1046,807">
       <p>NIE ... JEŽÍŠ. VŠETCI HLAVNÍ PREDSTAVITELIA KLANU PLATIA ZA PLNENIE DÔLEŽITÝCH MISIÍ PENIAZMI.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="964,1241 968,1223 976,1207 994,1193 1018,1185 1046,1181 1080,1185 1100,1191 1116,1201 1126,1215 1132,1233 1132,1253 1128,1265 1120,1277 1108,1287 1094,1293 1074,1299 1028,1299 1006,1295 988,1287 976,1275 968,1259">
       <p>OKREM TOHO, MÔJ KONTAKT MI POVEDAL, ŽE CHCÚ, ABY SME IŠLI <emphasis>POZABÍJAŤ</emphasis> NEJAKÝCH CHALANOV.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="228,1415 232,1399 242,1387 256,1381 274,1377 300,1377 322,1381 334,1389 344,1401 346,1417 342,1433 328,1447 312,1453 270,1455 256,1451 242,1445 232,1433 230,1425 228,1415">
       <p>OH, V <emphasis>TOM</emphasis> SME VEĽMI DOBRÉ!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1020,1391 1028,1383 1220,1383 1228,1391 1228,1463 1216,1471 1028,1471 1020,1459" bgcolor="#000000" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt;prosím, prepáč, môžeš mať moje zlato, prepáč!!!!!!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="612,1739 616,1725 624,1715 638,1709 658,1703 694,1701 726,1703 754,1709 770,1717 778,1727 780,1739 778,1751 770,1761 758,1767 736,1773 700,1777 662,1773 632,1765 618,1755 614,1747">
       <p>SI <emphasis>ODPORNÝ</emphasis> ČLOVEK, ANDA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="616,1843 624,1837 896,1837 904,1843 904,1899 896,1907 624,1909 616,1901" bgcolor="#000000" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt;Ja som Fahrenheit!!!!!</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <frame points="135,170 429,173 426,764 134,762"/>
   <frame points="438,173 996,173 990,767 438,761"/>
   <frame points="1008,175 1011,174 1104,174 1108,172 1114,171 1108,155 1111,149 1115,152 1124,164 1129,161 1133,167 1161,167 1173,170 1179,168 1184,174 1199,169 1201,175 1226,176 1227,761 1215,755 1197,752 1179,749 1128,749 1107,752 1089,755 1074,761 1065,767 1005,767"/>
   <frame points="60,764 855,767 861,1352 57,1346"/>
