  <page>
   <image href="03.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="129,185 389,185 389,261 129,261" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>THE MISSION TOOK THEM TO A COTTAGE ON THE FAR SIDE OF THE GAMEWORLD.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="394,312 401,283 429,261 471,251 504,249 551,254 588,268 605,289 610,313 605,338 591,357 561,371 528,378 484,379 444,372 413,357 397,333">
       <p>GOOD THING YOU HAD A <emphasis>SCRYING</emphasis> SCROLL LEFT. LOOKS LIKE THE PLACE IS PRETTY WELL-DEFENDED.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="523,432 528,413 547,400 579,393 614,394 646,403 661,423 660,440 652,455 626,466 592,469 561,468 538,459 525,444">
       <p>YEAH, I COUNT SEVEN GUARDS.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="863,173 1153,172 1163,186 1170,203 1167,222 1151,243 1124,256 1091,267 1039,271 984,271 937,269 893,258 863,241">
       <p>NOT A PROBLEM. MY STANDARD <emphasis>DODGE-AND-WEAVE</emphasis> PATTERN WORKS GREAT FOR RUSHING <emphasis>NON-PLAYER CHARACTERS.</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="930,547 934,529 952,517 983,509 1018,513 1041,523 1050,536 1050,554 1041,570 1019,579 990,581 960,578 939,567 931,556">
       <p>RIGHT. I'LL COVER YOU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="77,786 80,768 98,752 125,746 159,750 183,762 190,781 190,798 180,815 166,823 143,827 112,826 89,817 78,800">
       <p>THIS'LL BE OVER BEFORE -</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="284,1178 290,1161 309,1150 333,1148 361,1155 370,1174 369,1190 358,1203 337,1208 311,1208 292,1198">
       <p>WHAT THE - ?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="433,790 438,769 451,753 475,743 504,741 541,744 565,757 576,776 578,799 573,816 554,831 528,838 495,839 466,834 446,823 435,806">
       <p>SARGE. I THINK THEY'RE ACTUALLY <emphasis>PLAYERS!</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="819,788 825,766 858,746 906,737 967,736 1016,746 1042,761 1052,780 1052,800 1037,822 991,839 933,844 872,837 843,825 822,806">
       <p>BUT WHO WANTS TO <emphasis>SIT AROUND</emphasis> IN GAMESPACE WATCHING A BORING ROAD ALL DAY?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="899,1131 903,1114 921,1103 948,1099 984,1103 1001,1116 1005,1135 996,1152 975,1162 935,1164 909,1156 898,1142">
       <p>WHO CARES?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="270,1360 278,1339 305,1326 345,1322 385,1326 410,1335 422,1352 423,1369 418,1380 396,1395 352,1402 307,1398 279,1385 271,1370">
       <p>GET DOWN. I'M GONNA USE THE <emphasis>BFG!</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="133,1740 616,1741 617,1832 133,1833" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>EVERY GAME HAD ONE: <emphasis>THE BIG FRIENDLY GUN.</emphasis> THE GENERIC TERM FOR THE BADDEST-ARSE WEAPON IN THE WORLD. LUCY HAD RENTED THIS ONE FROM THE CLAN ARMORY FOR A SMALL FORTUNE IN GOLD.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="695,1426 700,1413 719,1405 743,1403 771,1406 787,1416 791,1428 785,1440 768,1449 724,1450 702,1443 695,1434">
       <p>HOLY - !</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="129,185 389,185 389,261 129,261" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>MISIA ICH ZAVIEDLA DO CHATRČE NA VZDIALENEJ STRANE HERNÉHO SVETA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="394,312 401,283 429,261 471,251 504,249 551,254 588,268 605,289 610,313 605,338 591,357 561,371 528,378 484,379 444,372 413,357 397,333">
       <p>JE DOBRE, ŽE TI EŠTE ZOSTAL JEDEN <emphasis>MAGICKÝ</emphasis> ZVITOK. VYZERÁ TO, ŽE TOTO MIESTO JE VEĽMI DOBRE BRÁNENÉ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="523,432 528,413 547,400 579,393 614,394 646,403 661,423 660,440 652,455 626,466 592,469 561,468 538,459 525,444">
       <p>ÁNO, NAPOČÍTALA SOM SEDEM STRÁŽCOV.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="863,173 1153,172 1163,186 1170,203 1167,222 1151,243 1124,256 1091,267 1039,271 984,271 937,269 893,258 863,241">
       <p>ŽIADEN PROBLÉM. MÔJ ŠTANDARTNÝ <emphasis>UHNI-A-SEKNI</emphasis> VZOREC FUNGUJE VYNIKAJÚCO NA ÚTOČIACE <emphasis>NEHRÁČSKE POSTAVY.</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="930,547 934,529 952,517 983,509 1018,513 1041,523 1050,536 1050,554 1041,570 1019,579 990,581 960,578 939,567 931,556">
       <p>OK. BUDEM ŤA KRYŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="77,786 80,768 98,752 125,746 159,750 183,762 190,781 190,798 180,815 166,823 143,827 112,826 89,817 78,800">
       <p>TOTO BUDE HOTOVÉ PREDTÝM NEŽ -</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="284,1178 290,1161 309,1150 333,1148 361,1155 370,1174 369,1190 358,1203 337,1208 311,1208 292,1198">
       <p>ČO DO - ?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="433,790 438,769 451,753 475,743 504,741 541,744 565,757 576,776 578,799 573,816 554,831 528,838 495,839 466,834 446,823 435,806">
       <p>SERŽANT. MYSLÍM, ŽE SÚ TO SKUTOČNÍ <emphasis>HRÁČI!</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="819,788 825,766 858,746 906,737 967,736 1016,746 1042,761 1052,780 1052,800 1037,822 991,839 933,844 872,837 843,825 822,806">
       <p>ALE KOMU SA CHCE <emphasis>SEDIEŤ NA JEDNOM MIESTE</emphasis> V HERNOM SVETE A SLEDOVAŤ JEDNU NUDNÚ CESTU CELÝ DEŇ?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="899,1131 903,1114 921,1103 948,1099 984,1103 1001,1116 1005,1135 996,1152 975,1162 935,1164 909,1156 898,1142">
       <p>ČO MA DO TOHO?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="270,1360 278,1339 305,1326 345,1322 385,1326 410,1335 422,1352 423,1369 418,1380 396,1395 352,1402 307,1398 279,1385 271,1370">
       <p>KRY SA. IDEM POUŽIŤ <emphasis>VPZ!</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="133,1740 616,1741 617,1832 133,1833" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>KAŽDÁ HRA JU MALA: <emphasis>VEĽKÚ PRIATEĽSKÚ ZBRAŇ.</emphasis> VŠEOBECNÝ TERMÍN PRE NAJSILNEJŠIU ZBRAŇ V CELOM SVETE. LUCY SI TÚTO POŽIČALA ZO ZBROJNICE KLANU ZA MENŠÍ OBNOS ZLATA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="695,1426 700,1413 719,1405 743,1403 771,1406 787,1416 791,1428 785,1440 768,1449 724,1450 702,1443 695,1434">
       <p>PRE PÁNA - !</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <frame points="113,171 841,171 842,711 113,709"/>
   <frame points="860,170 1202,170 1206,714 860,713"/>
   <frame points="53,730 403,728 400,1281 53,1281"/>
   <frame points="420,731 794,731 795,1281 418,1281"/>
