   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="143,184 153,174 377,174 387,183 388,255 380,263 153,264 143,258" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; that's who you're about to deprive of a day's wages.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="805,158 1036,158 1046,171 1051,183 1051,207 1036,231 1009,247 980,255 939,259 912,260 871,257 837,250 813,240 806,233">
       <p>OH, <emphasis>HELL NO!</emphasis> I <emphasis>KILLED</emphasis> HIM LAST TIME AND I SAID I'D DO IT AGAIN IF HE <emphasis>EVER</emphasis> TRIED TO SHOW ME PHOTOS.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1059,556 1061,538 1070,520 1086,509 1109,504 1131,504 1152,509 1167,518 1178,537 1180,556 1177,578 1167,594 1142,606 1118,609 1092,605 1071,592 1061,575">
       <p>LUCY, <emphasis>DON'T.</emphasis> HE DESERVES TO HAVE A SAY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="141,677 147,670 319,670 326,678 328,753 321,761 147,761 140,753" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; what do you want from me, raymond?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="428,697 437,686 617,686 626,697 625,796 617,808 439,808 428,801" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; don't kill them. let them have their wages. go play somewhere else.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="138,1113 150,1104 431,1106 444,1114 445,1181 435,1192 153,1193 138,1185" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; they're leeches. they don't care about the game and neither do you</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="743,675 752,666 1176,666 1182,675 1184,757 1175,768 755,769 743,761" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; if they don't play the game, they don't eat. I think that means that they care about the game as much as you do.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="739,1092 750,1082 1175,1083 1188,1093 1190,1177 1176,1190 751,1192 737,1181" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; you're being paid cash to kill them, yes? so you need to play for your money, too. I think that makes you and them a little the same</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="545,1296 552,1280 567,1270 592,1269 619,1271 633,1281 639,1295 634,1311 620,1320 594,1325 567,1321 550,1311">
       <p>LUCY, <emphasis>DON'T!</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="701,1722 708,1711 824,1711 833,1717 833,1776 829,1784 707,1784 700,1777" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; go screw yourself</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="143,184 153,174 377,174 387,183 388,255 380,263 153,264 143,258" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; to sú dievčatá, ktoré hodláte zbaviť ich denných zárobkov.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="805,158 1036,158 1046,171 1051,183 1051,207 1036,231 1009,247 980,255 939,259 912,260 871,257 837,250 813,240 806,233">
       <p>ACH, <emphasis>DO PEKLA!</emphasis> <emphasis>ZABILA</emphasis> SOM HO NAPOSLEDY A POVEDALA SOM, ŽE TO SPRAVÍM ZNOVA, KEĎ SA MI OPOVÁŽI <emphasis>NIEKEDY</emphasis> UKÁZAŤ TIE FOTKY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1059,556 1061,538 1070,520 1086,509 1109,504 1131,504 1152,509 1167,518 1178,537 1180,556 1177,578 1167,594 1142,606 1118,609 1092,605 1071,592 1061,575">
       <p>LUCY, <emphasis>PRESTAŇ.</emphasis> ZASLÚŽI SI POVEDAŤ, ČO CHCE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="141,677 147,670 319,670 326,678 328,753 321,761 147,761 140,753" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; čo odo mňa chceš, Raymond?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="428,697 437,686 617,686 626,697 625,796 617,808 439,808 428,801" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; nezabíjaj ich. nechaj ich mať svoje zárobky. choď hrať niekam inam.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="138,1113 150,1104 431,1106 444,1114 445,1181 435,1192 153,1193 138,1185" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; sú to pijavice. nezáleží im na hre a ani tebe nezáleží</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="743,675 752,666 1176,666 1182,675 1184,757 1175,768 755,769 743,761" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; keď nebudú hrať hru, tak nebudú jesť. myslím, že im záleží na hre minimálne tak ako vám.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="739,1092 750,1082 1175,1083 1188,1093 1190,1177 1176,1190 751,1192 737,1181" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; dostávate zaplatené za to, že ich zabíjate, že? takže hráte takisto pre peniaze. myslím, že to máte s nimi spoločné</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="545,1296 552,1280 567,1270 592,1269 619,1271 633,1281 639,1295 634,1311 620,1320 594,1325 567,1321 550,1311">
       <p>LUCY, <emphasis>PRESTAŇ!</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="701,1722 708,1711 824,1711 833,1717 833,1776 829,1784 707,1784 700,1777" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; choď do pekla</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
