  <page>
   <image href="18.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="347,132 350,120 364,109 389,104 414,107 430,117 436,134 431,152 408,163 390,165 361,161 349,148">
       <p>YOU <emphasis>BITCH!</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="514,183 518,157 530,135 560,118 599,113 639,117 665,130 682,155 686,178 681,208 667,228 642,244 616,248 576,247 546,237 522,216 517,199">
       <p>I'M SORRY, LUCY. BUT I DON'T WANT YOU TO <emphasis>HURT</emphasis> HIM. I WANT TO <emphasis>HEAR</emphasis> HIM OUT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1117,124 1123,105 1139,90 1168,83 1199,83 1225,89 1240,100 1250,125 1243,148 1229,158 1205,166 1163,167 1135,158 1120,140">
       <p>LUCY? STAY ON <emphasis>VOICE,</emphasis> PLEASE?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="491,934 497,930 625,929 633,939 632,1005 627,1014 498,1014 491,1007" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; dont lucy come on talk2me</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="915,662 922,643 941,633 960,631 984,634 999,644 1004,662 1000,678 988,689 961,695 932,690 918,678">
       <p>BLOODY HELL.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="347,132 350,120 364,109 389,104 414,107 430,117 436,134 431,152 408,163 390,165 361,161 349,148">
       <p>TY <emphasis>SUKA!</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="514,183 518,157 530,135 560,118 599,113 639,117 665,130 682,155 686,178 681,208 667,228 642,244 616,248 576,247 546,237 522,216 517,199">
       <p>JE MI TO ĽÚTO, LUCY. ALE JA HO NECHCEM <emphasis>ZRANIŤ.</emphasis> CHCEM HO <emphasis>VYPOČUŤ.</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1117,124 1123,105 1139,90 1168,83 1199,83 1225,89 1240,100 1250,125 1243,148 1229,158 1205,166 1163,167 1135,158 1120,140">
       <p>LUCY? <emphasis>ROZPRÁVAJ</emphasis> SO MNOU, PROSÍM?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="491,934 497,930 625,929 633,939 632,1005 627,1014 498,1014 491,1007" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; prestaň lucy, rozprávaj so mnou</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="915,662 922,643 941,633 960,631 984,634 999,644 1004,662 1000,678 988,689 961,695 932,690 918,678">
       <p>DO PEKLA.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <frame points="62,71 62,62 56,39 66,39 98,69 206,70 234,61 705,57 709,227 724,205 728,209 724,225 708,265 709,569 59,570"/>
   <frame points="722,59 1265,59 1268,569 723,570"/>
   <frame points="59,584 174,584 174,576 172,566 174,557 191,547 199,547 210,540 219,540 218,546 210,556 211,567 222,565 236,563 242,565 261,577 266,584 653,584 655,1043 309,1045 299,1066 279,1095 250,1127 229,1141 224,1134 220,1108 223,1078 227,1062 238,1043 60,1045"/>
   <frame points="667,584 1267,582 1266,1041 669,1046"/>
   <frame points="38,1060 1292,1059 1296,1951 41,1951"/>
  </page>
  <page>
   <image href="19.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="959,196 970,188 1182,188 1192,196 1192,267 1183,275 972,277 961,269" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; I'm very sorry you and your friend quarreled.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="77,617 87,609 524,608 534,618 533,759 525,769 86,770 79,762" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; the enemy isn't the players guarding the fabrica, and it's not the girls working there. the people who are working to destroy the game are the people who pay you and the girls in the fabrica. but they are the same people.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="451,1040 463,1031 730,1032 746,1044 744,1145 735,1157 466,1158 450,1147" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; you're being paid by rival factory owners, you know that? they are the ones who care nothing for the game.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="809,641 817,633 1007,634 1016,642 1017,857 1011,866 817,867 810,858" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; my girls care about the game. you care about the game. your common enemy is the people who want to destroy the game and who destroy the lives of these girls.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="919,985 923,973 933,964 957,961 983,964 997,974 998,985 994,997 974,1006 943,1007 926,1000 920,991">
       <p>LUCY?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="103,1216 379,1215 379,1301 103,1301" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>THERE WERE LOTS OF <emphasis>RULES</emphasis> FOR FAHRENHEITS, AND THE <emphasis>PENALTIES</emphasis> FOR BREAKING THEM VARIED.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="914,1242 1197,1242 1197,1313 914,1313" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>BUT ANDA KNEW THE PENALTY FOR ATTACKING A FELLOW FAHRENHEIT: <emphasis>EXPULSION.</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="959,196 970,188 1182,188 1192,196 1192,267 1183,275 972,277 961,269" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; je mi to veľmi ľúto, že ste sa ty a tvoja kamarátka pohádali.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="77,617 87,609 524,608 534,618 533,759 525,769 86,770 79,762" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; nepriateľom nie sú hráči strážiaci továrne, a nie sú to dievčatá pracujúce v nich. ľudia, ktorí sa snažia zničiť hru, sú ľudia, ktorí platia vás a dievčatá v továrňach. sú to rovnakí ľudia.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="451,1040 463,1031 730,1032 746,1044 744,1145 735,1157 466,1158 450,1147" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; vy ste platené súperiacimi majiteľmi tovární, viete to? to sú tí, ktorým vôbec nezáleží na hre.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="809,641 817,633 1007,634 1016,642 1017,857 1011,866 817,867 810,858" bgcolor="#11161a" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>&gt; mojim dievčatám na hre záleží. tebe na hre záleží. vášim spoločným nepriateľom sú ľudia, ktorí sa snažia zničiť hru a životy týchto dievčat.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="919,985 923,973 933,964 957,961 983,964 997,974 998,985 994,997 974,1006 943,1007 926,1000 920,991">
       <p>LUCY?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="103,1216 379,1215 379,1301 103,1301" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>EXISTOVALO VIACERO <emphasis>PRAVIDIEL</emphasis> V KLANE FAHRENHEIT, A <emphasis>TRESTY</emphasis> ZA ICH PORUŠENIE SA RÔZNILI.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="914,1242 1197,1242 1197,1313 914,1313" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>AVŠAK ANDA POZNALA TREST ZA ÚTOK NA ČLENA KLANU FAHRENHEIT: <emphasis>VYLÚČENIE.</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <frame points="41,54 1298,53 1298,354 1213,351 1209,174 943,173 944,352 42,351"/>
   <frame points="41,363 945,365 944,549 1214,549 1214,367 1296,367 1298,616 540,616 532,604 528,602 83,605 71,614 43,614"/>
   <frame points="943,172 1210,173 1213,549 947,551"/>
   <frame points="64,615 72,614 76,608 83,603 530,602 536,608 540,616 773,616 775,1183 64,1188 64,620"/>
   <frame points="784,616 1270,616 1273,1170 784,1188 788,1128"/>
   <frame points="124,1491 97,1304 99,1210 384,1210 506,1368 508,1947 120,1946"/>
   <frame points="521,1204 835,1203 1187,1203 1188,1235 1202,1235 1203,1320 1194,1320 1197,1534 1212,1523 1215,1945 518,1946"/>
  </page>
  <page>
   <image href="20.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="877,520 882,499 899,483 921,475 934,473 973,473 992,477 1009,484 1022,499 1027,515 1025,536 1014,553 994,564 978,569 936,569 915,565 902,561 886,549 878,532">
       <p>ANDA, DEAR, THERE'S A PHONE CALL FOR YOU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1004,610 1006,592 1016,577 1034,566 1051,562 1084,563 1102,567 1119,579 1128,591 1131,607 1127,628 1120,640 1106,651 1088,656 1054,657 1031,652 1016,642 1010,634 1005,620">
       <p>SOMEONE FROM YOUR GAME, I THINK.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="168,735 172,724 184,716 201,713 229,713 247,717 257,723 261,734 259,745 249,753 233,757 210,759 186,755 174,748 170,741">
       <p>HULLO?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="141,870 143,857 151,847 164,841 178,839 206,839 220,843 234,853 240,867 239,878 230,893 210,893 192,902 161,900 147,891 142,878">
       <p>HULLO, CHICKEN.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="518,914 523,900 533,894 553,892 567,893 581,899 588,911 587,922 581,931 571,936 557,938 535,937 524,930 519,922">
       <p>LIZA?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="422,1180 425,1165 434,1153 449,1143 468,1137 491,1135 525,1136 546,1139 564,1147 576,1157 583,1170 584,1192 575,1207 564,1215 548,1222 526,1226 486,1227 462,1223 434,1209 425,1196">
       <p>YES, CAN YOU TELL ME WHAT HAPPENED TODAY?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="661,714 938,714 938,785 661,785" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE DID STUMBLING OVER THE DETAILS, BACK-TRACKING AND STUTTERING.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="672,870 676,843 686,827 705,814 726,807 747,804 788,804 807,808 829,817 843,829 851,844 855,862 856,878 851,897 842,912 826,925 809,933 800,936 786,936 734,936 714,930 696,922 681,906 672,885">
       <p>- AND I ... I DON'T THINK IT'S <emphasis>RIGHT</emphasis> TO KILL THEM, THOSE GIRLS. ALL RIGHT?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="671,1152 674,1127 684,1109 700,1096 719,1087 742,1079 782,1078 819,1079 844,1085 862,1093 880,1106 889,1121 894,1137 894,1167 888,1184 877,1200 860,1210 844,1217 828,1222 810,1224 762,1224 737,1221 720,1217 697,1205 684,1193 674,1173">
       <p>WELL, I HAPPEN TO AGREE. THOSE GIRLS NEED OUR <emphasis>HELP</emphasis> MORE THAN ANY OF THE GIRLS ANYWHERE IN THE GAME.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="973,1192 978,1166 992,1145 1015,1130 1037,1123 1059,1119 1114,1121 1142,1127 1167,1140 1179,1151 1189,1173 1192,1191 1190,1215 1178,1237 1154,1253 1141,1259 1112,1266 1061,1267 1038,1263 1018,1257 998,1246 982,1229 974,1206">
       <p>THE FAHRENHEITS' <emphasis>STRENGTH</emphasis> IS THAT WE <emphasis>CARE.</emphasis> IT'S ANOTHER WAY THAT WE'RE BETTER THAN THE BOYS.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="120,1373 125,1353 136,1340 154,1330 172,1325 221,1325 249,1331 265,1340 274,1352 280,1370 277,1392 270,1404 251,1415 233,1421 216,1422 182,1423 153,1417 137,1408 125,1395 121,1384">
       <p>I'M <emphasis>PROUD</emphasis> THAT YOU TOOK A STAND WHEN YOU DID.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="87,1672 93,1651 111,1637 136,1631 160,1630 197,1632 218,1641 229,1652 233,1663 233,1680 226,1693 213,1703 196,1709 163,1712 134,1710 107,1702 94,1691 89,1681">
       <p>YOU'RE NOT GOING TO <emphasis>EXPELL</emphasis> ME?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="222,1784 225,1767 235,1753 253,1742 272,1737 320,1737 340,1741 354,1747 369,1761 374,1778 375,1792 369,1808 355,1823 338,1830 324,1833 276,1833 254,1828 240,1820 229,1809 223,1793">
       <p>NO, CHICKEN. I THINK YOU DID THE RIGHT THING?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="460,1362 465,1344 477,1332 493,1325 517,1321 549,1321 573,1327 588,1336 596,1347 600,1363 595,1382 582,1395 562,1402 541,1404 516,1405 488,1399 476,1392 465,1380 461,1368">
       <p>IF YOU EXPELL LUCY, I'LL <emphasis>QUIT</emphasis> ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="627,1411 631,1391 643,1375 660,1365 686,1359 723,1359 747,1365 765,1375 776,1389 781,1412 776,1435 766,1448 747,1460 734,1463 704,1466 676,1463 658,1458 638,1444 628,1426">
       <p>OH, CHICKEN, YOU'RE <emphasis>BRAVE</emphasis> THING, AREN'T YOU?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="451,1776 455,1755 468,1738 484,1727 503,1720 533,1716 585,1715 617,1722 649,1741 659,1757 663,1777 659,1798 649,1813 629,1826 612,1833 582,1838 523,1837 494,1831 474,1820 461,1807 453,1791">
       <p>NO ONE'S BEING EXPELLED, FEAR NOT. BUT I WANTA <emphasis>TALK</emphasis> TO THIS RAYMOND OF YOURS.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="877,520 882,499 899,483 921,475 934,473 973,473 992,477 1009,484 1022,499 1027,515 1025,536 1014,553 994,564 978,569 936,569 915,565 902,561 886,549 878,532">
       <p>ANDA, MILÁČIK, MÁŠ TELEFÓN.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1004,610 1006,592 1016,577 1034,566 1051,562 1084,563 1102,567 1119,579 1128,591 1131,607 1127,628 1120,640 1106,651 1088,656 1054,657 1031,652 1016,642 1010,634 1005,620">
       <p>NIEKTO Z TVOJEJ HRY, MYSLÍM.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="168,735 172,724 184,716 201,713 229,713 247,717 257,723 261,734 259,745 249,753 233,757 210,759 186,755 174,748 170,741">
       <p>HALÓ?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="141,870 143,857 151,847 164,841 178,839 206,839 220,843 234,853 240,867 239,878 230,893 210,893 192,902 161,900 147,891 142,878">
       <p>HALÓ, MAČIATKO.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="518,914 523,900 533,894 553,892 567,893 581,899 588,911 587,922 581,931 571,936 557,938 535,937 524,930 519,922">
       <p>LÍZA?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="422,1180 425,1165 434,1153 449,1143 468,1137 491,1135 525,1136 546,1139 564,1147 576,1157 583,1170 584,1192 575,1207 564,1215 548,1222 526,1226 486,1227 462,1223 434,1209 425,1196">
       <p>ÁNO, MÔŽEŠ MI VYSVETLIŤ, ČO SA DNES STALO?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="661,714 938,714 938,785 661,785" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>ŤAŽKO SA JEJ VYSVETĽOVALI VŠETKY DETAILY NERVÓZNE A KOKTAJÚC.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="672,870 676,843 686,827 705,814 726,807 747,804 788,804 807,808 829,817 843,829 851,844 855,862 856,878 851,897 842,912 826,925 809,933 800,936 786,936 734,936 714,930 696,922 681,906 672,885">
       <p>- A JA ... JA SI NEMYSLÍM, ŽE JE <emphasis>SPRÁVNE</emphasis> ICH ZABÍJAŤ, TIETO DIEVČATÁ. HMM?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="671,1152 674,1127 684,1109 700,1096 719,1087 742,1079 782,1078 819,1079 844,1085 862,1093 880,1106 889,1121 894,1137 894,1167 888,1184 877,1200 860,1210 844,1217 828,1222 810,1224 762,1224 737,1221 720,1217 697,1205 684,1193 674,1173">
       <p>HMM, JA SÚHLASÍM. TIETO DIEVČATǍ POTREBUJÚ NAŠU <emphasis>POMOC</emphasis> VIAC AKO KTORÉKOĽVEK DIEVČATÁ V HRE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="973,1192 978,1166 992,1145 1015,1130 1037,1123 1059,1119 1114,1121 1142,1127 1167,1140 1179,1151 1189,1173 1192,1191 1190,1215 1178,1237 1154,1253 1141,1259 1112,1266 1061,1267 1038,1263 1018,1257 998,1246 982,1229 974,1206">
       <p><emphasis>SILA</emphasis> KLANU FAHRENHEIT JE? ŽE NÁM NA VECIACH <emphasis>ZÁLEŽÍ.</emphasis> JE TO ĎAĽŠIA VEC, V KTOREJ SME LEPŠIE AKO CHLAPCI.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="120,1373 125,1353 136,1340 154,1330 172,1325 221,1325 249,1331 265,1340 274,1352 280,1370 277,1392 270,1404 251,1415 233,1421 216,1422 182,1423 153,1417 137,1408 125,1395 121,1384">
       <p>SOM <emphasis>PYŠNÁ,</emphasis> ŽE SI ZAUJALA SVOJ POSTOJ K VECI.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="87,1672 93,1651 111,1637 136,1631 160,1630 197,1632 218,1641 229,1652 233,1663 233,1680 226,1693 213,1703 196,1709 163,1712 134,1710 107,1702 94,1691 89,1681">
       <p>NECHYSTÁŠ SA MA <emphasis>VYLÚČIŤ?</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="222,1784 225,1767 235,1753 253,1742 272,1737 320,1737 340,1741 354,1747 369,1761 374,1778 375,1792 369,1808 355,1823 338,1830 324,1833 276,1833 254,1828 240,1820 229,1809 223,1793">
       <p>NIE, MAČIATKO. MYSLÍM SI, ŽE SI SPRAVILA SPRÁVNU VEC?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="460,1362 465,1344 477,1332 493,1325 517,1321 549,1321 573,1327 588,1336 596,1347 600,1363 595,1382 582,1395 562,1402 541,1404 516,1405 488,1399 476,1392 465,1380 461,1368">
       <p>AK VYLÚČIŠ LUCY, JA <emphasis>KONČÍM</emphasis> ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="627,1411 631,1391 643,1375 660,1365 686,1359 723,1359 747,1365 765,1375 776,1389 781,1412 776,1435 766,1448 747,1460 734,1463 704,1466 676,1463 658,1458 638,1444 628,1426">
       <p>ACH, MAČIATKO, SI VEĽMI <emphasis>ODVÁŽNA,</emphasis> ŽE?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="451,1776 455,1755 468,1738 484,1727 503,1720 533,1716 585,1715 617,1722 649,1741 659,1757 663,1777 659,1798 649,1813 629,1826 612,1833 582,1838 523,1837 494,1831 474,1820 461,1807 453,1791">
       <p>NIKTO NEBUDE VYLÚČENÝ, NEBOJ SA. ALE CHCEM SA <emphasis>POROZPRÁVAŤ</emphasis> S TÝM VAŠIM RAYMONDOM.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
