  <page>
   <image href="21.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="165,296 170,272 183,254 207,243 243,239 275,241 303,251 316,262 325,281 327,296 325,314 315,333 296,346 273,354 257,357 236,355 208,351 183,339 169,321 165,309">
       <p>DID YOU HAVE A FUN AFTERNOON ON THE <emphasis>HOCKEY PITCH?</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="528,295 532,283 543,275 561,271 592,271 610,275 621,283 625,294 623,305 610,315 592,320 563,319 550,317 533,309 529,302">
       <p>YES, DA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="494,593 500,575 517,565 537,561 564,561 589,567 603,578 607,592 605,607 594,619 575,625 553,627 526,625 505,616 497,605">
       <p>THAT'S MY GIRL.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="622,619 628,600 639,587 657,579 675,575 709,575 738,581 752,589 761,599 766,611 766,635 760,649 750,659 738,665 724,669 711,671 677,671 657,667 639,659 629,648 623,633">
       <p>WELL, I JUST WANTED TO SAY ... THAT IS ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="916,214 918,194 925,181 940,164 960,153 991,145 1033,142 1075,145 1106,153 1128,165 1143,182 1150,202 1150,229 1142,250 1125,265 1108,275 1065,285 1029,287 988,283 964,277 946,268 927,253 918,233">
       <p>... YOUR MUM AND ME ARE QUITE <emphasis>PROUD</emphasis> OF YOU. AND WE'VE MOVED YOUR <emphasis>PC</emphasis> BACK INTO YOUR ROOM. YOU'VE <emphasis>EARNED</emphasis> IT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="987,477 991,465 1001,459 1020,455 1050,455 1060,461 1069,470 1070,481 1065,491 1051,497 1037,499 1018,499 1000,495 990,489 988,485">
       <p>OH, DA!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="869,580 874,553 886,538 908,529 931,525 952,525 975,529 990,535 1004,547 1012,563 1014,579 1010,602 999,619 978,629 960,633 925,633 903,629 887,621 876,609 870,595">
       <p>IT'S ALL RIGHT, GIRL. WE'RE JUST <emphasis>PROUD</emphasis> OF YOU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="849,767 854,753 863,745 874,741 912,741 925,745 934,753 938,763 938,774 934,782 927,790 920,793 902,797 886,797 873,795 859,789 852,780">
       <p>HI, SARGE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1086,801 1089,785 1097,773 1110,765 1128,760 1156,761 1173,766 1190,775 1196,792 1196,810 1190,825 1179,834 1167,840 1153,841 1126,841 1111,837 1098,831 1090,820 1086,808">
       <p>HI, ANDA. CALL ME LUCY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1049,1212 1051,1200 1060,1190 1074,1185 1091,1182 1116,1182 1132,1184 1147,1190 1156,1198 1161,1212 1158,1226 1148,1235 1137,1240 1126,1242 1084,1242 1066,1237 1055,1231 1050,1222">
       <p>OK, SAR - LUCY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="139,1380 141,1359 150,1342 162,1330 179,1321 195,1315 209,1311 223,1310 266,1310 296,1315 311,1319 326,1327 341,1340 350,1356 353,1372 353,1395 346,1413 333,1429 320,1437 305,1444 288,1448 273,1451 219,1450 196,1446 172,1437 153,1423 141,1398">
       <p>SO, LISTEN ... I'VE BEEN TALKING TO RAYMOND A <emphasis>LOT</emphasis> ABOUT THE WORKING CONDITIONS IN THE <emphasis>FACTORY,</emphasis> AND, WELL ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="357,1440 361,1423 373,1412 389,1406 420,1405 439,1410 454,1418 459,1433 459,1451 451,1465 438,1473 422,1476 399,1478 381,1474 364,1462 357,1450">
       <p>... I'M <emphasis>SORRY,</emphasis> ANDA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="165,1527 171,1509 183,1500 197,1496 233,1496 251,1503 261,1512 265,1526 262,1542 252,1552 240,1559 194,1558 177,1552 171,1545 167,1537">
       <p>ME, TOO, LUCY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="133,1705 139,1681 151,1670 167,1662 183,1657 238,1658 253,1663 271,1671 281,1683 285,1692 285,1716 278,1731 265,1741 251,1748 238,1752 192,1752 176,1749 154,1741 141,1730 135,1717">
       <p>YOU DON'T HAVE ANYTHING TO BE SORRY ABOUT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="306,1765 309,1743 320,1726 339,1713 362,1706 395,1704 427,1708 451,1718 465,1732 473,1752 473,1778 466,1799 450,1812 435,1820 414,1824 388,1826 358,1824 339,1818 320,1804 311,1793 307,1777">
       <p>IT'S HORRIBLE, I KNOW, BUT I <emphasis>MISS</emphasis> THE BIG FIGHTS. THE BIG STAKES ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="931,1412 934,1394 945,1379 963,1369 975,1364 995,1364 1018,1364 1042,1368 1060,1376 1073,1386 1078,1400 1080,1416 1075,1432 1066,1444 1050,1453 1034,1457 1008,1460 977,1457 953,1449 937,1435 932,1422">
       <p>I <emphasis>KNOW,</emphasis> ME, TOO. WHAT'RE WE GONNA DO?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="925,1596 930,1575 940,1563 956,1554 973,1550 1008,1550 1031,1555 1048,1566 1056,1581 1059,1595 1056,1615 1047,1628 1034,1636 1018,1642 1003,1644 980,1644 947,1636 933,1623 926,1606">
       <p>WE'LL ASK <emphasis>RAYMOND</emphasis> HOW WE CAN HELP.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="165,296 170,272 183,254 207,243 243,239 275,241 303,251 316,262 325,281 327,296 325,314 315,333 296,346 273,354 257,357 236,355 208,351 183,339 169,321 165,309">
       <p>MALA SI VESELÉ POPOLUDNIE NA <emphasis>HOKEJOVOM IHRISKU?</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="528,295 532,283 543,275 561,271 592,271 610,275 621,283 625,294 623,305 610,315 592,320 563,319 550,317 533,309 529,302">
       <p>ÁNO, OCO.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="494,593 500,575 517,565 537,561 564,561 589,567 603,578 607,592 605,607 594,619 575,625 553,627 526,625 505,616 497,605">
       <p>TO JE MOJE DIEVČA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="622,619 628,600 639,587 657,579 675,575 709,575 738,581 752,589 761,599 766,611 766,635 760,649 750,659 738,665 724,669 711,671 677,671 657,667 639,659 629,648 623,633">
       <p>NO, LEN SOM TI CHCEL POVEDAŤ ... ŽE ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="916,214 918,194 925,181 940,164 960,153 991,145 1033,142 1075,145 1106,153 1128,165 1143,182 1150,202 1150,229 1142,250 1125,265 1108,275 1065,285 1029,287 988,283 964,277 946,268 927,253 918,233">
       <p>... TVOJA MAMA A JA SME NA TEBA VEĽMI <emphasis>PYŠNÍ.</emphasis> A VRÁTILI SME TI TVOJ <emphasis>POČÍTAČ</emphasis> SPÄŤ DO IZBY. <emphasis>ZASLÚŽILA</emphasis> SI SI TO.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="987,477 991,465 1001,459 1020,455 1050,455 1060,461 1069,470 1070,481 1065,491 1051,497 1037,499 1018,499 1000,495 990,489 988,485">
       <p>ACH, OCO!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="869,580 874,553 886,538 908,529 931,525 952,525 975,529 990,535 1004,547 1012,563 1014,579 1010,602 999,619 978,629 960,633 925,633 903,629 887,621 876,609 870,595">
       <p>TO JE V PORIADKU, ĎIEVČATKO. SME LEN NA TEBA <emphasis>PYŠNÍ.</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="849,767 854,753 863,745 874,741 912,741 925,745 934,753 938,763 938,774 934,782 927,790 920,793 902,797 886,797 873,795 859,789 852,780">
       <p>AHOJ, SERŽANT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1086,801 1089,785 1097,773 1110,765 1128,760 1156,761 1173,766 1190,775 1196,792 1196,810 1190,825 1179,834 1167,840 1153,841 1126,841 1111,837 1098,831 1090,820 1086,808">
       <p>AHOJ, ANDA. VOLAJ MA LUCY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1049,1212 1051,1200 1060,1190 1074,1185 1091,1182 1116,1182 1132,1184 1147,1190 1156,1198 1161,1212 1158,1226 1148,1235 1137,1240 1126,1242 1084,1242 1066,1237 1055,1231 1050,1222">
       <p>OK, SER... LUCY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="139,1380 141,1359 150,1342 162,1330 179,1321 195,1315 209,1311 223,1310 266,1310 296,1315 311,1319 326,1327 341,1340 350,1356 353,1372 353,1395 346,1413 333,1429 320,1437 305,1444 288,1448 273,1451 219,1450 196,1446 172,1437 153,1423 141,1398">
       <p>TAK, POČÚVAJ ... ROZPRÁVALA SOM SA <emphasis>DLHO</emphasis> S RAYMONDOM O PRACOVNÝCH PODMIENKACH V <emphasis>TOVÁRŇACH,</emphasis> A, NO ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="357,1440 361,1423 373,1412 389,1406 420,1405 439,1410 454,1418 459,1433 459,1451 451,1465 438,1473 422,1476 399,1478 381,1474 364,1462 357,1450">
       <p>... JE MI TO <emphasis>ĽÚTO,</emphasis> ANDA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="165,1527 171,1509 183,1500 197,1496 233,1496 251,1503 261,1512 265,1526 262,1542 252,1552 240,1559 194,1558 177,1552 171,1545 167,1537">
       <p>MNE, TAKISTO, LUCY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="133,1705 139,1681 151,1670 167,1662 183,1657 238,1658 253,1663 271,1671 281,1683 285,1692 285,1716 278,1731 265,1741 251,1748 238,1752 192,1752 176,1749 154,1741 141,1730 135,1717">
       <p>TEBE NEMÁ ČO BYŤ ĽÚTO, ANDA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="306,1765 309,1743 320,1726 339,1713 362,1706 395,1704 427,1708 451,1718 465,1732 473,1752 473,1778 466,1799 450,1812 435,1820 414,1824 388,1826 358,1824 339,1818 320,1804 311,1793 307,1777">
       <p>JE TO STRAŠNÉ, VIEM, ALE <emphasis>CHÝBAJÚ</emphasis> MI VEĽKÉ BOJE. VEĽKÉ STÁVKY ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="931,1412 934,1394 945,1379 963,1369 975,1364 995,1364 1018,1364 1042,1368 1060,1376 1073,1386 1078,1400 1080,1416 1075,1432 1066,1444 1050,1453 1034,1457 1008,1460 977,1457 953,1449 937,1435 932,1422">
       <p>JA <emphasis>VIEM,</emphasis> MNE, TAKISTO. ČO BUDEME ROBIŤ?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="925,1596 930,1575 940,1563 956,1554 973,1550 1008,1550 1031,1555 1048,1566 1056,1581 1059,1595 1056,1615 1047,1628 1034,1636 1018,1642 1003,1644 980,1644 947,1636 933,1623 926,1606">
       <p>SPÝTAME SA <emphasis>RAYMONDA</emphasis> AKO MÔŽME POMÔCŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <frame points="129,153 829,155 833,700 128,704"/>
   <frame points="843,156 947,155 970,144 1007,138 1067,138 1104,145 1122,155 1223,156 1221,697 843,700"/>
   <frame points="456,714 130,714 129,1276 456,1276"/>
   <frame points="467,855 559,846 577,861 578,879 657,834 734,808 806,790 809,1277 471,1276"/>
   <frame points="820,712 1221,710 1219,1277 822,1277"/>
   <frame points="129,1289 182,1290 174,1267 171,1250 178,1253 200,1289 483,1290 485,1834 129,1834 129,1755 124,1756 124,1751 129,1744 128,1455 122,1456 124,1452 129,1445"/>
   <frame points="498,1491 578,1448 585,1428 623,1380 646,1352 685,1339 714,1342 726,1348 762,1352 791,1357 895,1312 994,1286 1218,1287 1218,1840 500,1838"/>
  </page>
  <page>
   <image href="22.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="283,267 285,251 294,233 312,217 337,205 374,198 405,197 437,199 477,209 502,223 515,241 521,268 516,294 507,309 488,324 459,335 433,339 380,340 356,336 328,329 305,316 288,295 283,279">
       <p>I WANT THEM TO WALK OUT ... TO GO ON <emphasis>STRIKE</emphasis> IN CIUDAD JUAREZ AND TIJUANA. IT'S THE ONLY WAY TO GET RESULTS.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="312,635 314,617 320,601 330,591 346,581 368,573 393,570 429,570 454,573 473,579 492,591 507,611 511,633 505,663 489,680 466,693 443,698 416,700 389,699 358,692 336,683 323,671 313,651">
       <p>I'LL CALL THE <emphasis>PRESS</emphasis> IN. WE'LL MAKE A BIG DEAL OUT OF IT. WE CAN <emphasis>WIN,</emphasis> I <emphasis>KNOW</emphasis> WE CAN.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="779,329 781,316 791,304 807,296 829,291 860,291 880,295 896,302 907,314 909,329 907,342 899,353 889,361 866,367 848,369 826,367 809,364 792,355 783,345">
       <p>SO WHAT'S THE PROBLEM?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="698,687 701,667 711,651 727,638 748,629 784,623 847,623 879,629 895,635 915,648 927,663 933,690 927,716 914,734 893,745 868,753 819,757 792,757 763,753 736,744 716,733 705,719 699,704">
       <p>GETTING THEM ORGANIZED. WE'VE BEEN TRYING FOR <emphasis>YEARS,</emphasis> BUT THEY LOCK THE DOORS AND KEEP US OUT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="981,723 983,705 993,687 1012,674 1035,667 1064,665 1097,667 1129,680 1145,699 1149,721 1142,749 1124,765 1091,775 1041,775 1011,767 993,754 983,737">
       <p>BUT IN THE GAME, I THOUGHT I'D BE ABLE TO REACH THEM -</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="170,892 173,875 179,862 193,852 215,846 229,845 250,848 269,857 279,869 283,882 283,905 277,921 268,931 256,937 239,941 215,941 197,937 183,928 172,913">
       <p>BUT THE <emphasis>BOSSES</emphasis> KEEP YOU AWAY?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="391,900 393,883 403,865 425,849 449,841 500,837 543,839 578,849 599,865 609,884 611,899 605,925 591,941 567,953 540,958 497,961 463,959 431,951 412,940 397,923 393,913">
       <p>I KEEP GETTING <emphasis>KILLED.</emphasis> I'VE BEEN PRACTISING MY <emphasis>SWORDFIGHTING,</emphasis> BUT IT'S SO HARD ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="249,1247 626,1247 625,1304 249,1305" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>THE BOSSES HIRED SOME PRETTY <emphasis>MEAN</emphasis> MERCS, ANDA KNEW. SHE'D BEEN ONE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="787,886 791,867 805,851 828,843 846,842 873,845 893,855 903,869 906,888 901,911 891,922 869,931 840,933 825,931 807,925 794,913 788,899">
       <p>THIS WILL BE <emphasis>FUN!</emphasis> LET'S GO.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="945,875 951,861 965,853 993,851 1011,851 1031,857 1039,864 1041,875 1035,889 1023,895 1001,898 973,897 957,893 947,884">
       <p>WHERE?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="752,1225 757,1201 771,1184 797,1171 830,1166 868,1166 901,1177 923,1198 929,1224 923,1253 906,1270 882,1281 841,1285 800,1281 783,1275 761,1257 755,1245">
       <p>TO AN IN-GAME FACTORY. WE'RE RAYMOND'S NEW <emphasis>BODYGUARDS!</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="231,1365 234,1353 239,1347 247,1343 259,1343 275,1345 282,1353 285,1365 283,1379 271,1386 255,1389 243,1385 235,1378">
       <p>OH!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="449,1390 453,1376 463,1367 482,1361 505,1361 523,1367 535,1378 537,1391 533,1407 523,1415 512,1419 498,1421 473,1419 459,1413 451,1402">
       <p>HEY, LUCY -</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="845,1788 849,1769 861,1755 881,1745 905,1741 934,1741 961,1747 979,1757 988,1772 991,1787 987,1810 974,1823 953,1833 918,1835 895,1835 869,1827 855,1817 847,1801">
       <p>- LET'S GO GET US A COUPLE <emphasis>BFGs,</emphasis> OK?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1059,1799 1156,1800 1160,1806 1160,1831 1157,1837 1061,1837 1057,1830 1057,1803" bgcolor="#f8ffc9">
       <p>THE END.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="283,267 285,251 294,233 312,217 337,205 374,198 405,197 437,199 477,209 502,223 515,241 521,268 516,294 507,309 488,324 459,335 433,339 380,340 356,336 328,329 305,316 288,295 283,279">
       <p>CHCEM, ABY VYŠLI VON ... ABY ŠLI DO <emphasis>ŠTRAJKU</emphasis> V CIUDAD JUAREZ A V TIJUANA. JE TO JEDINÝ SPÔSOB, AKO DOSIAHNUŤ NEJAKÉ VÝSLEDKY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="312,635 314,617 320,601 330,591 346,581 368,573 393,570 429,570 454,573 473,579 492,591 507,611 511,633 505,663 489,680 466,693 443,698 416,700 389,699 358,692 336,683 323,671 313,651">
       <p>ZAVOLÁM <emphasis>TLAČ.</emphasis> UROBÍME Z TOHO VEĽKÚ VEC. MÔŽME <emphasis>VYHRAŤ,</emphasis> <emphasis>VIEM,</emphasis> ŽE TO DOKÁŽEME.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="779,329 781,316 791,304 807,296 829,291 860,291 880,295 896,302 907,314 909,329 907,342 899,353 889,361 866,367 848,369 826,367 809,364 792,355 783,345">
       <p>TAK V ČOM JE PROBLÉM?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="698,687 701,667 711,651 727,638 748,629 784,623 847,623 879,629 895,635 915,648 927,663 933,690 927,716 914,734 893,745 868,753 819,757 792,757 763,753 736,744 716,733 705,719 699,704">
       <p>ZORGANIZOVAŤ ICH. SNAŽÍME SA O TO UŽ <emphasis>ROKY,</emphasis> ALE ZAMKNÚ DVERE A DRŽIA NÁS MIMO.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="981,723 983,705 993,687 1012,674 1035,667 1064,665 1097,667 1129,680 1145,699 1149,721 1142,749 1124,765 1091,775 1041,775 1011,767 993,754 983,737">
       <p>ALE V HRE SOM SI MYSLEL, ŽE SA K NIM DOSTANEM -</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="170,892 173,875 179,862 193,852 215,846 229,845 250,848 269,857 279,869 283,882 283,905 277,921 268,931 256,937 239,941 215,941 197,937 183,928 172,913">
       <p>ALE <emphasis>ŠÉFOVIA</emphasis> ŤA DRŽIA MIMO?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="391,900 393,883 403,865 425,849 449,841 500,837 543,839 578,849 599,865 609,884 611,899 605,925 591,941 567,953 540,958 497,961 463,959 431,951 412,940 397,923 393,913">
       <p>NEUSTÁLE MA <emphasis>ZABIJÚ.</emphasis> SNAŽIL SOM SA CVIČIŤ <emphasis>BOJ S MEČOM,</emphasis> ALE JE TO PRÍLIŠ ŤAŽKÉ ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="249,1247 626,1247 625,1304 249,1305" bgcolor="#f3ff9d" type="commentary">
       <p>ŠÉFOVIA NAJALI NIEKOĽKO VEĽMI <emphasis>SILNÝCH</emphasis> ŽOLDNIEROV, ANDA TO VEDELA. BOLA JEDNÝM Z NICH.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="787,886 791,867 805,851 828,843 846,842 873,845 893,855 903,869 906,888 901,911 891,922 869,931 840,933 825,931 807,925 794,913 788,899">
       <p>TOTO BUDE <emphasis>ZÁBAVNÉ!</emphasis> POĎME.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="945,875 951,861 965,853 993,851 1011,851 1031,857 1039,864 1041,875 1035,889 1023,895 1001,898 973,897 957,893 947,884">
       <p>KAM?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="752,1225 757,1201 771,1184 797,1171 830,1166 868,1166 901,1177 923,1198 929,1224 923,1253 906,1270 882,1281 841,1285 800,1281 783,1275 761,1257 755,1245">
       <p>DO TOVÁRNE. SME RAYMONDOVI NOVÍ <emphasis>BODYGUARDI!</emphasis></p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="231,1365 234,1353 239,1347 247,1343 259,1343 275,1345 282,1353 285,1365 283,1379 271,1386 255,1389 243,1385 235,1378">
       <p>ÓÓ!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="449,1390 453,1376 463,1367 482,1361 505,1361 523,1367 535,1378 537,1391 533,1407 523,1415 512,1419 498,1421 473,1419 459,1413 451,1402">
       <p>HEJ, LUCY -</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="845,1788 849,1769 861,1755 881,1745 905,1741 934,1741 961,1747 979,1757 988,1772 991,1787 987,1810 974,1823 953,1833 918,1835 895,1835 869,1827 855,1817 847,1801">
       <p>- POĎME VZIAŤ NIEKOĽKO <emphasis>VPZtiek,</emphasis> OK?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="1059,1799 1156,1800 1160,1806 1160,1831 1157,1837 1061,1837 1057,1830 1057,1803" bgcolor="#f8ffc9">
       <p>KONIEC.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
